            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual atributo do objeto de resposta contém o código de status da requisição?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.content</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>response.status_code</code>.</p></body></html>",
